HorizonSentinel is an async Python pipeline that automates regulatory intelligence.
It scrapes live legal portals, structures raw text, and secures data with SHA-256 validation seals.
An underlying auditor instantly weighs discovered rules against active operational profiles to flag drift.
The system bridges the gap between fast-moving legislation and compliance reality via an immutable ledger.

